div.p:
A. Possible Conflicts: Zaire;
                    Ogaden/Ethiopia-Somalia; Sino-Viet (Soviet); Egypt-Libya; Argentina-Chile
                    (perhaps drawing in Peru and Bolivia).

B. Possible Instability: Turkey; Post-Tito Yugoslavia; Iran; China; Egypt; Poland;
                    El Salvador; Saudi Arabia; Pakistan; Zambia; Romania; Sudan; the Philippines;
                    and countries moving to democracy, e.g., Nigeria, Brazil, Ecuador, Bolivia.
